<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OPTICAL CABLE STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OPTICAL CABLE STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>SoundView Financial Group Inc said analyst Chandan Sarkar initiated coverage of Optical Cable Corp as short-term hold, long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- said set fiscal 1997 earnings estimates of $0.23 a share and fiscal 1998 estimates of $0.29 a share.</p>
<p>-- Optical Cable gained 3/4 to 15-3/4.</p>
